=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: `test_total = pytest.mark.slow(test_total)` is a decoration, and the test stays live
origin: #424, ruling 424 Q5 (a) - an unknown wrapper keeps the test live
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
import pytest

from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75


test_total = pytest.mark.slow(test_total)
